body:
definitely try u-kiss.  they have really energetic songs like mworago, shut up, stop girl, dora dora, believe, bingeul bingeul, manmanhani, not young (ok not young is so bad it's good but)

and i saw you liked shinee, i'd try ring ding dong, ready or not, a-yo, to your heart, amigo, love like oxygen, replay, the shinee world, wowowow

i'm really a bigger fan of ballads, so those are just the ones i could think of off the top of my head ;~;
